PiPNN — SISAP 2026 Task 1
=========================

This repository contains the binary submitted to the SISAP 2026 Indexing Challenge
(Task 1) and the source that produces it.

The engine source under engine/ derives from PipNN / ParlayANN and is distributed
under the MIT License (see LICENSE).


